	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE D1:\nPorts only: no parts yet. Serial DAC on the isolated side; its output is DAC_CMD into U3 on [6] (G = 5.02 with RG3 fitted, so a +/-1 V full scale; RG3 DNP for a +/-5 V DAC). Bipolar output vs. unipolar + offset, reference, LDAC/CLR handling and the isolated supply come with the part. DAC_CMD is driven from this sheet only; J3 [5] carries SPI, not the analog command."
